    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/5110ce462895aae7f6f2b4a418b0179f.poster.avif?t=1755102398\" width=616 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/5110ce462895aae7f6f2b4a418b0179f.webm?t=1755102398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/5110ce462895aae7f6f2b4a418b0179f.mp4?t=1755102398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BERSERKER'S DOMAIN</strong> is a fast-paced, unhinged retro FPS freakshow with a roguelike loop, inspired by classics like <i>Blood</i>, <i>Quake 1-3</i>, and <i>Doom</i>, as well as modern shooters like <i>Dusk</i>, <i>ULTRAKILL</i>, and <i>Doom Eternal</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve died \u2014 only to be unleashed into an afterlife full of <strong>ultraviolence</strong>, <strong>explosions</strong>, <strong>gibs</strong>, <strong>fun</strong>, and <strong>fresh</strong>\u00a0<strong>victims</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/9e590810d01bf46a9a3ab8b990600749.poster.avif?t=1755102398\" width=616 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/9e590810d01bf46a9a3ab8b990600749.webm?t=1755102398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/9e590810d01bf46a9a3ab8b990600749.mp4?t=1755102398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, dash, and double-jump around the battlefield at <strong>break-neck speed</strong>, tearing through swarms of cultists, demons, monsters, soldiers, sorcerers, and demigods.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a brutal arsenal of <strong>nasty-ass weapons</strong>, each with a bunch of <strong>nonsense upgrades</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock ultimate &quot;synergy upgrades&quot; that combine bonuses from different weapons. Want a Dynamite that explodes into shotgun pellets? Sure, why not.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/aa6e10302441a835085b65e04f57ac99.poster.avif?t=1755102398\" width=616 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/aa6e10302441a835085b65e04f57ac99.webm?t=1755102398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/aa6e10302441a835085b65e04f57ac99.mp4?t=1755102398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the\u00a0<strong>Play</strong>\u00a0button and you're shooting stuff in 5 seconds.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No menus, no waiting for load screens, no tutorials. Just run the game and have fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each death starts a new, <strong>randomized run</strong> with fresh maps, weapons, upgrades, and enemies. No two runs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run. Hunt. RAMPAGE</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/5110ce462895aae7f6f2b4a418b0179f.poster.avif?t=1755102398\" width=616 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/5110ce462895aae7f6f2b4a418b0179f.webm?t=1755102398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/5110ce462895aae7f6f2b4a418b0179f.mp4?t=1755102398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BERSERKER'S DOMAIN</strong> is a fast-paced, unhinged retro FPS freakshow with a roguelike loop, inspired by classics like <i>Blood</i>, <i>Quake 1-3</i>, and <i>Doom</i>, as well as modern shooters like <i>Dusk</i>, <i>ULTRAKILL</i>, and <i>Doom Eternal</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve died \u2014 only to be unleashed into an afterlife full of <strong>ultraviolence</strong>, <strong>explosions</strong>, <strong>gibs</strong>, <strong>fun</strong>, and <strong>fresh</strong>\u00a0<strong>victims</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/9e590810d01bf46a9a3ab8b990600749.poster.avif?t=1755102398\" width=616 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/9e590810d01bf46a9a3ab8b990600749.webm?t=1755102398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/9e590810d01bf46a9a3ab8b990600749.mp4?t=1755102398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, dash, and double-jump around the battlefield at <strong>break-neck speed</strong>, tearing through swarms of cultists, demons, monsters, soldiers, sorcerers, and demigods.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a brutal arsenal of <strong>nasty-ass weapons</strong>, each with a bunch of <strong>nonsense upgrades</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock ultimate &quot;synergy upgrades&quot; that combine bonuses from different weapons. Want a Dynamite that explodes into shotgun pellets? Sure, why not.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/aa6e10302441a835085b65e04f57ac99.poster.avif?t=1755102398\" width=616 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/aa6e10302441a835085b65e04f57ac99.webm?t=1755102398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/aa6e10302441a835085b65e04f57ac99.mp4?t=1755102398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the\u00a0<strong>Play</strong>\u00a0button and you're shooting stuff in 5 seconds.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No menus, no waiting for load screens, no tutorials. Just run the game and have fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each death starts a new, <strong>randomized run</strong> with fresh maps, weapons, upgrades, and enemies. No two runs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run. Hunt. RAMPAGE</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "BERSERKER'S DOMAIN is a stupid, super fast little FPS with roguelike elements. Inspired by Quake, Doom, ULTRAKILL, and Blood. No load screens, tutorials or menus - just click Play and you're shooting stuff in 5 seconds. Quick play sessions and randomized runs for endless mindless fun.",
